        "smpLabelRotate": 45
      }
    },
    "about": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "How this dashboard is built\n\n• Join: tumour samples carry their own ids; the cohort source joins expression to clinical on patient_id.\n• Relationships: labs relate to patients, so selecting patients in any chart marks their lab visits (and vice versa).\n• Filters panel: filters the cohort and, through the relationship, the labs. Try the saved schemes.\n• R function: the gene chart is computed by R on the joined cohort (needs a server with data functions enabled).\n• One point per patient: the survival curve and the PD-L1 scatter plot the table rows directly."
    }
  },
